  "scope": "Actual joint L2 block and smooth compact energy integration, SAME law/kernels/operators and classical integral representative; actual variance equals microscopic block norm-square. Full rough L2-H1/outer closed-gradient/Gamma/half-turn/main/implementation error/expected costs/composition remain separate.",
